{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2021-08-20 11:00:00', 'title': 'VERIZON FRONTLINE DEPLOYED TO SUPPORT EMERGENCY RESPONSE EFFORTS IN N.C.', 'text': 'HAYWOOD COUNTY, N.C., AUG. 20, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \xa0 VERIZON FRONTLINE DEPLOYED ITS ADVANCED PUBLIC SAFETY PLATFORMS AND TECHNOLOGY WEDNESDAY, VIA THE VERIZON RESPONSE TEAM , TO SUPPORT FIRST RESPONDERS IN WESTERN NORTH CAROLINA CONDUCTING RESCUE OPERATIONS AND DEALING WITH EXTENSIVE FLOOD DAMAGE CAUSED BY TROPICAL STORM FRED.'}